2:[['Example 1: Choosing α','A hospital tests a new drug and wants only a 1% risk of wrongly claiming it works. It sets α = 0.01, so the critical values for a two-tailed Z test are ±2.576.'],['Example 2: Decision','A two-tailed Z test at α = 0.05 gives Z = 2.31. Since |2.31| > 1.96, the statistic falls in the rejection region: reject H₀.']],
